      "lines": [
        "990．把二项式写成两个式子的和与差的积：",
        "а) $1-a^2b^2$；　　　　　　　　　б) $0.64-a^4$；",
        "в) $1\\frac{17}{64}b^2-\\frac{4}{9}c^2$；　　　　　　г) $0.09x^6-0.49y^2$；",
        "д) $\\frac{1}{16}b^4-0.25x^2$；　　　　　　е) $1.21a^2-0.36b^6$．"
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "ex",
      "label": "991",
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": false,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "991．求值：",
        "а) $532^2-531^2$；　　　　　　　б) $748^2-252^2$；",
        "в) $5.97^2-4.03^2$；　　　　　　г) $24.7^2-14.7^2$；",
        "д) $\\left(5\\frac{3}{4}\\right)^2-\\left(4\\frac{1}{4}\\right)^2$；　　　　е) $\\left(8\\frac{5}{7}\\right)^2-\\left(1\\frac{2}{7}\\right)^2$；",
        "ж) $0.845^2-0.155^2$；　　　　　з) $1.215^2-0.785^2$；",
        "и) $0.063^2-0.013^2$．"
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "ex",
      "label": "992",
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": false,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "992．证明：等式",
        "$(a+b)(a-b)-(a+c)(a-c)=(c+b)(c-b)$",
        "是恒等式．",
        "利用这个恒等式计算：",
        "а) $303\\cdot297-307\\cdot293$；　б) $1008\\cdot992-1012\\cdot988$．"
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "ex",
      "label": "993",
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": false,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "993．约分：",
        "а) $\\frac{a-3}{a^2-9}$；　б) $\\frac{x+4}{x^2-16}$；　в) $\\frac{25-c^2}{2c-10}$；　г) $\\frac{x^2-64}{3x-24}$；",
        "д) $\\frac{a^2-7a}{49-a^2}$；　е) $\\frac{x^3-4x}{10-5x}$；　ж) $\\frac{5x^2-35x}{49-x^2}$；　з) $\\frac{x^3+2x^2y}{4y^2-x^2}$．"
      ]
    },
